# Override the legacy scan 0x1a -> F20 mapping seen with genkernel-built images.
# Remove after validating corrected initramfs policy without this workaround.
# See kanban/Open/020-initramfs-keyboard-policy.md.
# Defer the builtin until assignments finish: IMPORT runs before ENV assignments.
ACTION=="add|change", SUBSYSTEM=="input", KERNEL=="event*", \
  ATTRS{name}=="ThinkPad Extra Buttons", \
  ATTR{[dmi/id]sys_vendor}=="LENOVO", ATTR{[dmi/id]product_name}=="21TDCTO1WW", \
  ENV{KEYBOARD_KEY_1a}="micmute", RUN{builtin}+="keyboard"
